<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN" data-enhance-nav="false">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <base href="/" />
    <script src="js/theme.js"></script>
    <link rel="manifest" href="manifest.webmanifest" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#1b6ec2" />
    <meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes" />
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="DataTrace" />
    <link href="_content/MudBlazor/MudBlazor.min.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="app.css?v=20260929-chart-readout" />
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="icons/datatrace-192.png" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="favicon.png" />
    <HeadOutlet @rendermode="InteractiveServer" />
    <title>DataTrace</title>
</head>
<body>
    <Routes @rendermode="InteractiveServer" />
    @* Blazor Server 掉线时页面只会静静停住，产线上极易被误读成"采集停了"。
       提供自定义节点后由 blazor.web.js 切换 show/failed 类，样式见 app.css。 *@
    <div id="components-reconnect-modal" class="components-reconnect-hide">
        <div class="dt-reconnect try">
            <b>与页面的连接已中断，正在重连…</b>
            看板数值此刻不会刷新，服务端采集不受影响。
        </div>
        <div class="dt-reconnect dead">
            <b>重连失败</b>
            刷新页面即可恢复查看；采集与判定在后台照常运行。
        </div>
    </div>
    <script src="_content/MudBlazor/MudBlazor.min.js"></script>
    <script src="js/datatrace.js?v=20260929-chart-readout"></script>
    <script src="js/pwa.js"></script>
    <script src="_framework/blazor.web.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
